    [Misc] vllm main2main 1017 (#19302)
    
    ### What this PR does / why we need it?
    
    Port `vllm-ascend` to vLLM main `c0b6f74` (bumped from `a98247a`) while
    keeping the
    `v0.31.0` release lane green. The upstream window moved the KV-cache
    planning
    helpers into a new module, made EAGLE draft groups explicit, typed
    DeepSeek-V4
    configs through upstream Transformers, removed Medusa/MLP speculator
    support, and
    changed several spec-decode/KV-cache/EPLB signatures. Every gate below
    is either a
    `vllm_version_is("0.31.0")` split or an attribute/argument probe where
    two main dev
    builds share one version string.
    
